   "text": "Supplier invoice → payment for Harborline Logistics (CodeJam 16 · Brim). Every step audited. Payments are simulated.\nmake up = docker compose: web · api · worker · db.   No LLM: PDF text layer / Tesseract OCR + deterministic rules.   Money = integer cents.   Today = 2026-11-02.",
   "originalText": "Supplier invoice → payment for Harborline Logistics (CodeJam 16 · Brim). Every step audited. Payments are simulated.\nmake up = docker compose: web · api · worker · db.   No LLM: PDF text layer / Tesseract OCR + deterministic rules.   Money = integer cents.   Today = 2026-11-02.",
   "fontSize": 20,
