   "text": "every request carries X-User-Id; server decides\nAP clerks U004 Jordan, U005 Sam\n  sort · review · correct · prepare payments\nDept managers U007–U012 · step 1 (P01)\n  U012 Liam on leave → delegate U003\nFinance manager U003 Elise\n  FM steps · release ≤ $100k (P09)\nController U002 · CFO U001\n  P03/P04 steps · release > $100k (P10)\nAuditor U006 · read-only    Employees · none",
   "originalText": "every request carries X-User-Id; server decides\nAP clerks U004 Jordan, U005 Sam\n  sort · review · correct · prepare payments\nDept managers U007–U012 · step 1 (P01)\n  U012 Liam on leave → delegate U003\nFinance manager U003 Elise\n  FM steps · release ≤ $100k (P09)\nController U002 · CFO U001\n  P03/P04 steps · release > $100k (P10)\nAuditor U006 · read-only    Employees · none",
