   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Home · role to-dos · paid-this-year hero + monthly chart\nInbox · Sort emails · Upload · To review / On hold / Emails\nInvoice · ONE primary action · checks (+ acknowledge)\n  what we read + confidence · lines + GL reasons · history\nApprovals · only the step that is waiting for you now\nPayments · ready → to release → held → going out → paid\nVendors · onboard (live duplicate check) · approve · hold\n  bank change · verify by phone\nActivity · audit findings + append-only audit log",
   "originalText": "Home · role to-dos · paid-this-year hero + monthly chart\nInbox · Sort emails · Upload · To review / On hold / Emails\nInvoice · ONE primary action · checks (+ acknowledge)\n  what we read + confidence · lines + GL reasons · history\nApprovals · only the step that is waiting for you now\nPayments · ready → to release → held → going out → paid\nVendors · onboard (live duplicate check) · approve · hold\n  bank change · verify by phone\nActivity · audit findings + append-only audit log",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 14,
