   "originalText": "inbox.py    GET /emails · POST /inbox/process · POST /documents\ninvoices.py GET /invoices/{id} (+ actions for this user)\n  PATCH fields · PATCH lines/{n} · acknowledge · submit\n  approve · decline · reject · recheck · POST …/payment\npayments.py GET /payments · release · settle · cancel · recheck\nvendors.py  GET /vendors · /vendors/similar · POST /vendors\n  approve · hold · bank-changes · /bank-changes/{id}/verify\nhome · activity  /home · /approvals/mine · /audit\n  /findings · /reference",
