   "text": "run every check → store the reasons (keep acks)\nany block → on_hold\nwarn / doubtful field / no dept or requester → needs_review\nclean AND new → straight to approval (touchless) → route\nfound a split → re-check the sibling invoices",
   "originalText": "run every check → store the reasons (keep acks)\nany block → on_hold\nwarn / doubtful field / no dept or requester → needs_review\nclean AND new → straight to approval (touchless) → route\nfound a split → re-check the sibling invoices",
