   "text": "vendor pending_review or on_hold · unverified bank change · no bank account for EFT\nanother live payment for the same vendor + invoice number (\"would pay it twice\")\n→ history: PAY-00386 + PAY-00399 both scheduled for Summit #000804 → flagged on the dashboard",
