   "updated": 1763700000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "pay on the due date, or today if already due · method = vendor's preferred (EFT / cheque / card)\napproved credit notes deducted oldest first (Fixwell −$1,614.21 → next Fixwell payment)\nstopping a payment makes its credits available again · virtual card settles into card_transactions\nhistory statuses kept: scheduled (queued with the bank) · outstanding (cheque not cashed)",
   "originalText": "pay on the due date, or today if already due · method = vendor's preferred (EFT / cheque / card)\napproved credit notes deducted oldest first (Fixwell −$1,614.21 → next Fixwell payment)\nstopping a payment makes its credits available again · virtual card settles into card_transactions\nhistory statuses kept: scheduled (queued with the bank) · outstanding (cheque not cashed)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
