   "text": "paid twice: $23,601.92 to recover\n  EFT twice: AP-00023/34 · 00073/77 · 00136/155 · 00215/224\n  EFT + employee card: Paper Trail ×4 · Alpenglow ×2 (AL26-0663 ×3)\n  instalments of ONE invoice are not double payments\nabout to pay twice: AP-00394 + AP-00407 (Summit #000804)\nself-approvals: U010 on AP-00092, 00178, 00235 (P07)\nsplits: Northstar AP-00303/304 · Deskhive AP-00120/129/131",
   "originalText": "paid twice: $23,601.92 to recover\n  EFT twice: AP-00023/34 · 00073/77 · 00136/155 · 00215/224\n  EFT + employee card: Paper Trail ×4 · Alpenglow ×2 (AL26-0663 ×3)\n  instalments of ONE invoice are not double payments\nabout to pay twice: AP-00394 + AP-00407 (Summit #000804)\nself-approvals: U010 on AP-00092, 00178, 00235 (P07)\nsplits: Northstar AP-00303/304 · Deskhive AP-00120/129/131",
