   "text": "runs on a scratch database where the inbox was sorted and the worker read every document\n  for real (OCR, parsing, coding, checks, routing): no shortcuts, no fixtures\nprints a checklist: CAUGHT / MISSED per trap · proven to report MISSED (AP_TODAY=2027 → Summit)",
