   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Keystone end to end: acknowledge → submit → 2 approvals → pay → release refused (P11, P09)\n  → controller releases → settle → every step in the audit log\nP07 self-approval · P08 delegation recorded · P10 over $100k · auditor/employee/on-leave refused\nbank change: payments held · can't verify your own · old account printed = info, not block\nonboard Blue Heron from its invoice · duplicate vendor warning · double payment blocked",
   "originalText": "Keystone end to end: acknowledge → submit → 2 approvals → pay → release refused (P11, P09)\n  → controller releases → settle → every step in the audit log\nP07 self-approval · P08 delegation recorded · P10 over $100k · auditor/employee/on-leave refused\nbank change: payments held · can't verify your own · old account printed = info, not block\nonboard Blue Heron from its invoice · duplicate vendor warning · double payment blocked",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
